an is murdered during a demonstration. The government and army are trying to suppress the truth, but a tenacious magistrate is determined not to let them get away with it.","tagline":"He is alive!"},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Dans la Grèce contemporaine, les forces libérales s'opposent, de façon latente ou ouverte, au pouvoir. C'est dans ce climat tendu que débute le film, au moment où un groupe d'avocats et de militants libéraux ont organisé un meeting où parlera leur chef, le député Z.","tagline":"Il est vivant !"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hu3OiXkByeanrDUFTGHYOxhDcjW.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ofSyquvDw78bpOmDAwisAfQoBYQ.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":2721,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hu3OiXkByeanrDUFTGHYOxhDcjW.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hu3OiXkByeanrDUFTGHYOxhDcjW.jpg","language":"it","width":960,"height":1440},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hu3OiXkByeanrDUFTGHYOxhDcjW.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hu3OiXkByeanrDUFTGHYOxhDcjW.jpg","language":"it","width":960,"height":1440},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oOLugIyMoLGpBHuLXAcjFtLWj8Y.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oOLugIyMoLGpBHuLXAcjFtLWj8Y.jpg","language":"it","width":938,"height":1407}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dFAJyFNgvOv24f2RQyI9KDxjGr3.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dFAJyFNgvOv24f2RQyI9KDxjGr3.jpg","language":"en","width":1200,"height":1800},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dFAJyFNgvOv24f2RQyI9KDxjGr3.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p